Two pieces of template art in this directory come from elsewhere. Everything
else here was made for this repository.

patreon-paper.jpg
	"Texture of crumpled paper", a photograph from Pexels, under the Pexels
	licence, which allows any use, commercial use included, and asks for no
	attribution. What is kept here is a 1200 x 600 crop of it. The
	photograph is at:

	https://www.pexels.com/photo/texture-of-crumpled-paper-4834961/

	The terms are at:

	https://www.pexels.com/license/

translate-badge.svg
	The disc and the white rim were drawn here. The glyph on it is
	"translate" from Google's Material Symbols, copyright Google LLC,
	licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, which asks for no
	attribution and allows commercial use. The glyph is at:

	https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
